---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Distributors & Partners | Neovantis"
  description="Neovantis works with partners and distributors who value specialist medical solutions, reliable support, and long-term professional collaboration across South Africa and neighbouring African markets."
>

  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-bg" style="background-image:url('/images/distributors and partners hero.png')"></div>
    <div class="page-hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page-hero-content">
        <p style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:0.8rem;letter-spacing:0.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue-accent);margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Partner With Us</p>
        <h1>Distributors &<br/>Partners</h1>
        <div class="accent-bar" style="margin-left:auto;"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="section section--lg">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-2" style="align-items:center;gap:4rem;">
        <div>
          <p style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:0.8rem;letter-spacing:0.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue-accent);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Distribution Opportunities</p>
          <h2 style="margin-bottom:1rem;">A Broader Portfolio.<br/>A Stronger Partnership.</h2>
          <span class="accent-bar"></span>
          <p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Neovantis works with partners and distributors who value specialist medical solutions, reliable support, and long-term professional collaboration across South Africa and neighbouring African markets.</p>
          <p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Our expanded portfolio — spanning orthopaedic trauma, RF ablation pain management, neuro plating, urology, and radiation protection — gives distribution partners access to a broader, more commercially versatile product range, supported by the professional infrastructure of a South African-led medical company.</p>
          <p style="margin-bottom:2rem;">Whether you are an established surgical equipment distributor, a regional specialist, or a healthcare organisation exploring new supply relationships, we want to explore how a Neovantis partnership can strengthen your offering.</p>
          <a href="#partner-form" class="btn btn-primary">Discuss Distribution Opportunities</a>
        </div>
        <div style="border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(31,127,182,0.3);">
          <img src="/images/neovantis-distributor.png" alt="Neovantis distribution partnership" style="width:100%;height:420px;object-fit:cover;display:block;" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Benefits -->
  <section class="angled-panel">
    <div class="geo-overlay"></div>
    <div class="container" style="position:relative;z-index:2;">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2>Benefits of Partnership</h2>
        <div class="section-divider"></div>
        <p>Neovantis distribution partners receive comprehensive support to maximise their success across our specialist medical solution portfolio.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-3">
        {[
          { icon: '📦', title: 'Broad Product Portfolio', desc: 'Access to a growing portfolio spanning orthopaedics, pain management, neuro plating, urology, and radiation protection — increasing your commercial range and market reach.' },
          { icon: '🤝', title: 'Long-Term Collaboration', desc: 'We seek partners who value long-term professional relationships — built on mutual respect, shared goals, and dependable collaboration across the healthcare market.' },
          { icon: '🎓', title: 'Product Training & Support', desc: 'Comprehensive training on all product solution areas — including clinical applications, positioning, and sales support — for your distribution team.' },
          { icon: '📣', title: 'Marketing Support', desc: 'Access to Neovantis marketing materials, digital assets, and product documentation to support your territory activities and professional engagement.' },
          { icon: '💼', title: 'Dedicated Partner Support', desc: 'A dedicated Neovantis partner contact assigned to your account for ongoing commercial support, forecasting, and business development collaboration.' },
          { icon: '🌍', title: 'Regional Reach', desc: 'With a South African base and a vision for broader African reach, Neovantis partners are positioned to grow alongside a company committed to regional healthcare expansion.' },
        ].map(item => (
          <div class="card">
            <div class="feature-icon">{item.icon}</div>
            <h4 style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;">{item.title}</h4>
            <p style="font-size:0.9rem;">{item.desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Requirements -->
  <section class="section section--lg" style="background:var(--bg-secondary);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2>Partner Requirements</h2>
        <div class="section-divider"></div>
        <p>We seek distributors with the experience, infrastructure, and commitment to represent Neovantis professionally in the market.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-2" style="gap:2rem;">
        {[
          { title: 'Established Medical Device Experience', desc: 'Demonstrated track record in medical device distribution within South Africa or relevant African markets across specialist or surgical disciplines.' },
          { title: 'Regulatory Awareness', desc: 'Understanding of SAHPRA registration requirements and willingness to work within applicable regulatory frameworks for medical device distribution.' },
          { title: 'Healthcare Sector Relationships', desc: 'Existing relationships with hospitals, surgical centres, specialist practices, or procurement organisations in your target territory.' },
          { title: 'Professional Capability', desc: 'Capacity to represent Neovantis products professionally — including product knowledge, customer engagement, and basic technical support for healthcare clients.' },
        ].map(item => (
          <div class="card" style="display:flex;gap:1.25rem;">
            <span style="color:var(--blue-accent);font-size:1.5rem;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;">✓</span>
            <div>
              <h4 style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;">{item.title}</h4>
              <p style="font-size:0.9rem;">{item.desc}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Partner Form -->
  <section class="section section--lg" id="partner-form">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-2" style="gap:4rem;align-items:start;">
        <div>
          <p style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:0.8rem;letter-spacing:0.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue-accent);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Get Started</p>
          <h2 style="margin-bottom:1rem;">Distributor Enquiry</h2>
          <span class="accent-bar"></span>
          <p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Complete the form below to express your interest in a Neovantis distribution partnership. A member of our team will contact you within 3 business days to discuss your requirements.</p>
          <div class="contact-info-item">
            <div class="contact-info-icon">📞</div>
            <div class="contact-info-text">
              <h4>Direct Line</h4>
              <a href="tel:+27314631188">031 463 1188</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-info-item">
            <div class="contact-info-icon">✉️</div>
            <div class="contact-info-text">
              <h4>Email</h4>
              <a href="mailto:info@neovantis.co.za">info@neovantis.co.za</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <form
            name="distributor-enquiry"
            method="POST"
            data-netlify="true"
            netlify-honeypot="bot-field"
            class="card"
            style="padding:2rem;"
          >
            <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="distributor-enquiry" />
            <input type="hidden" name="bot-field" />
            <div class="form-row">
              <div class="form-group">
                <label>First Name *</label>
                <input type="text" name="first_name" required />
              </div>
              <div class="form-group">
                <label>Last Name *</label>
                <input type="text" name="last_name" required />
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label>Company / Organisation *</label>
              <input type="text" name="company" required />
            </div>
            <div class="form-row">
              <div class="form-group">
                <label>Email *</label>
                <input type="email" name="email" required />
              </div>
              <div class="form-group">
                <label>Phone *</label>
                <input type="tel" name="phone" required />
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label>Target Territory / Region</label>
              <input type="text" name="territory" placeholder="e.g. Gauteng, Western Cape, East Africa" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label>Areas of Interest</label>
              <select name="interest">
                <option value="">Select a solution area</option>
                <option value="orthopaedic-trauma">Orthopaedic Trauma Solutions</option>
                <option value="rf-ablation">RF Ablation & Pain Management</option>
                <option value="neuro-plating">Neuro Plating Systems</option>
                <option value="urology">Urology Solutions</option>
                <option value="radiation-gloves">Radiation Protection Gloves</option>
                <option value="full-portfolio">Full Portfolio</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label>Current Medical Device Lines</label>
              <textarea name="current_lines" rows="3" placeholder="Briefly describe your current product lines and customer base"></textarea>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label>Message</label>
              <textarea name="message" rows="3" placeholder="Tell us about your distribution interest and how you believe we can work together"></textarea>
            </div>
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" style="width:100%;justify-content:center;margin-top:0.5rem;">Submit Enquiry</button>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</MainLayout>
